@startuml Manager Upload Combo Image
title Sequence Diagram: Quản lý ảnh thực tế cho Combo (Task 5.1)
skinparam theme cerulean

actor Manager
boundary "manage-combos.html" as UI
control "ComboController" as Ctrl
entity "ComboMediaService" as MediaSvc
entity "CloudinaryService" as Cloudinary
entity "ComboService" as Svc
database "Database" as DB

== Tải lên ảnh Combo mới ==
Manager -> UI: Chọn tệp hình ảnh đồ ăn
UI -> UI: Hiển thị Preview ảnh local

Manager -> UI: Nhấn "Lưu Combo"
UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/combos (FormData: request + image)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> MediaSvc: uploadComboImage(imageFile)
activate MediaSvc
MediaSvc -> Cloudinary: upload(file, folder="combos")
Cloudinary --> MediaSvc: Secure URL
MediaSvc --> Ctrl: https://cloudinary.com/...
deactivate MediaSvc

Ctrl -> Svc: create/updateCombo(request, imageUrl)
Svc -> DB: save(combo)
Svc --> Ctrl: ComboResponse
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: 201 Created (Kèm URL ảnh thật)
deactivate Ctrl

UI -> Manager: Hiển thị Card Combo với ảnh vừa upload
@enduml
